{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Eisenhower 以四象限矩陣協助你按緊急與重要程度整理任務，分清該立即處理、安排時間、交給他人或直接放下的事項，適合工作繁忙、同時兼顧學業與副業的人。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-127.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>四象限矩陣與專注計時</h2>\n<p>Eisenhower 把任務分為立即處理、安排時間、交給他人與不予處理，每張清單最多保留八項，避免焦點分散；另設專注模式，選定一項重要任務後，以 30 分鐘或自訂計時器持續推進，並可將任務直接放入日曆或轉交同事。登入後可與網頁版即時同步，讓工作、學業與副業安排保持一致。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-115-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-116-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-117-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-118-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Eisenhower</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/eisenhower/id547099449?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.549880+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":296,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T19:47:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:37:25.417952+00:00"